flowchart TD
    A([Admin clicks Mint NFT on approved row]) --> B[handleMint sets mintModal = app]
    B --> C[MintConfirmModal renders\ntitle + student + course + irreversible warning]

    C --> D{Admin action}
    D -- clicks Cancel\nor Escape\nor backdrop --> E[setMintModal null\nmodal closes\nno state change]
    D -- clicks Mint NFT --> F[submitMint called]

    F --> G[setMintModal null — modal closes]
    G --> H[setActionLoading applicationId\nrow button shows Minting…]
    H --> I[adminCertificateService.mintApplication API call]

    I --> J{API result}
    J -- success --> K[setApplications updates row\nstatus changes to minted\ntxHash populated]
    J -- error --> L[setActionError per-row\ninline error shown below row]

    K --> M[setActionLoading null\nrow returns to normal]
    L --> M
